+
+### Steps
+
+Perform only the phase named by STATE:
+
+1. **Phase 1 — produce (first Claude):** run P-001 production and verification.
+   Create R-002 with the complete asset fields, both SHA-256 values, starting commit,
+   checker/time, `authority: provisional`, `provenance: durable-artifact`, and the
